# Prefer `Combobox` over deprecated `@grafana/ui` Select

In `public/app`, do **not** introduce new usages of deprecated Select exports from `@grafana/ui`:

`Select`, `MultiSelect`, `AsyncSelect`, `VirtualizedSelect`, `AsyncVirtualizedSelect`, `AsyncMultiSelect`

Use **`Combobox`** from `@grafana/ui` instead (see Storybook / design system docs for `Combobox`).

## Exceptions

- **Narrow edits**: If you only touch code next to an existing Select, you may keep behavior unchanged without a full migration.
- **Already changing the control**: Prefer migrating that control to `Combobox` rather than expanding deprecated APIs.

## Example

```tsx
// Avoid (deprecated Select family)
import { Select } from '@grafana/ui';

// Prefer
import { Combobox } from '@grafana/ui';
```

Reference: `@grafana/ui` marks the Select variants as `@deprecated` in favor of `Combobox` (`packages/grafana-ui/src/components/Select/Select.tsx`).
